# Scripted: a generated grid with houses, shops and industry gets a primary and a high school
# (ADR 0055). Children enrol at the nearest school with a free seat; the high school is
# bulldozed, undone back, and a second primary is placed and undone.
sim-game command log 1
seed 55
grid 6 6
1 fill 60 60 residential-low
1 fill 180 60 residential-low
1 fill 300 60 residential-low
1 fill 60 180 residential-low
1 fill 180 180 commercial-low
1 fill 300 180 industrial-low
1 fill 60 300 residential-low
1 fill 180 300 residential-low
2 plant 420 420 solar
600 school 240 305 primary
600 school 305 300 high
2400 delete 305 300
2500 undo
2600 school 420 185 primary
2700 undo
end 6000
expect hash f7361d3f4b08b304 population 33 buildings 20 trips 16
